# Progress Log

## 2026-08-31 - Session Bootstrap & Security Audit
- **Bootstrap**: Initialized FishDev AI workflow and verified SpecKit (`specify-cli 1.0.3.dev0`).
- **Security Audit**: Executed monthly dependency vulnerability audit via `npm audit`.
  - **Findings**: 5 vulnerabilities identified (1 low, 2 high, 2 critical) across `body-parser`, `nanoid`, `postcss`, `shell-quote` (via `concurrently`).
  - **Remediation**: Executed `npm audit fix`, updating 5 packages.
  - **Validation**: Re-ran `npm audit` confirming 0 vulnerabilities found.
- **Specification Release 0.001**: Created `specs/0/0.001-fishdev-bootstrap-and-security-audit/`.
- **Pull Request**: PR #1 merged into `main`.

## 2026-08-31 - Feature 0.002: Automated Daily Morning Data Update Engine
- **Engine Implementation**: Created `scripts/morning_sync.js` to handle SEC Form 144 daily index ingestion, contact enrichment, scoring, and regional apps sync.
- **Server Integration**: Added `/api/sync/status` and `/api/sync/trigger` endpoints in `server.js` with automatic on-boot catch-up sync and daily 8:00 AM EST timer.
- **System Automation**: Added `"sync:daily"` npm script, `scripts/com.scout144.morningupdate.plist` LaunchAgent template, and `scripts/setup_morning_launchagent.sh`.
- **Validation**: Executed live morning sync (ingested 524 Form 144 filings across recent business days, synchronized 12 regional cloud applications with HTTP 200 responses, verified Vite production build).
- **Pull Request**: PR #2 merged into `main`.

## 2026-08-31 - Feature 0.003: Launch Time Optimization & Benchmarking
- **Benchmarking Suite**: Created `scripts/benchmark_launch.js` and added `"benchmark"` npm script.
- **Compact Index Cache**: Implemented `cache/filings_index_cache.json` and `cache/filings_index_manifest.json` in `server.js` with incremental change detection (disk parse latency reduced by 73.5%).
- **Instant Server Listen**: Moved Express `app.listen()` to bind port 5005 immediately on process start (server ready latency reduced from 511ms to 165ms).
- **Active Readiness Polling**: Optimized `Launch Scout 144.command` with sub-50ms polling loop, eliminating hardcoded `sleep 2` delay.
- **Empirical Results**: Reduced total cold launch latency from ~2.61s down to ~0.18s (93.3% speedup).
- **Pull Request**: PR #3 merged into `main`.

## 2026-08-31 - Feature 0.004: End-to-End Timing Observability & Telemetry
- **Server Telemetry & Middleware**: Built `lib/telemetry.js` and request timing middleware injecting `X-Response-Time` and `Server-Timing` headers on all Express responses with colorized console logs.
- **Metrics Endpoints**: Added `GET /api/metrics` and `GET /api/observability` exposing memory usage, startup milestone breakdown, and route-level latency statistics.
- **Morning Sync Profiling**: Instrumented `scripts/morning_sync.js` with stage timing breakdown and filings/second throughput metrics.
- **Launcher Timestamp Profiling**: Updated `Launch Scout 144.command` with milestone latency loggers.
- **Frontend Telemetry Drawer**: Built `src/components/TelemetryDrawer.jsx` and mounted live latency badge in navbar.
- **Pull Request**: PR #4 merged into `main`.

